{"id":"5704","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5704_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-perlucidus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这个几乎深灰色的云层是典型的层积云属。它的云底相对较高，排列成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">延展的云片或云层，云素有点扁平</span>，可确定为成层云种。由于云层大部分<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">很蔽光，足以遮挡住太阳</span>，因此它是蔽光云类。然而，图像左下方<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>上有两个很小的间隙显露出蓝天；因此，我们可将这个范围的云确定为漏隙云类。在远处地平线附近，可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Art Rangno","location":"美国，亚利桑那州，皮马县，婴儿耶稣小道","latitude":"纬度: 32° 28' 31'' N","longitude":"经度: 110° 51' 54'' W","date":"18 May 2011 1042 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.9","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.9"},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5704_upper_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-perlucidus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>图片拍摄前几小时在美国亚利桑那州图森（WMO 72274）进行的探测显示，在平均海平面上方约3000米有水汽。计算显示，层积云层的云底高度估计为拍摄地的地表上空约2000米。这个云底估计是层积云的上限。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4557_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-and-cumulus-congestus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>浓密的层积云层整体上足够不透明，可被识别为蔽光层积云。其底面略显褶皱的结构（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>）因掠射的暮光照明而隐约可见。具有明显水平云底和较大垂直隆起的积云（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>）进入上层云中。还有一些碎积云<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云团</span>。</p>\n<p>该站点位于斯匹次卑尔根上空高压中心的南缘，处于极地海洋气团的东北气流中。</p></div>","copyright":"© T. Bergeron","location":"Stockholm, Sweden","latitude":"纬度: 59° 19' 45'' N","longitude":"经度: 18° 4' 7'' E","date":"01 September 1943 1600 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}